# AnAnArchiver compatibility fixes for official libarchive v3.8.10.
# Base: https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/commit/0c48412be2d94afe1859a807ea7896a18d8900bd
# Retains the previously validated Mbed TLS 4 / TF-PSA public API adapter,
# serialized PSA access, streaming AES-CTR, crypto-only discovery, and ZIP
# compressor/crypto cleanup on cancelled or failed writes, plus regression tests.
# These changes are applied only to a generated export of the official source.
# Review and retire the corresponding hunks when upstream incorporates fixes;
# failed or reverse application is an error, never an unrecorded fallback.
